      "statement": "Every server follows the same six-step build-day flow from RUN-SHEET.md: (1) common/01-base-admin-network-updates.sh reboots, (2) common/02-domain-nvidia.sh reboots, (3) common/03-storage-ollama.sh is inference hosts only, (4) the application block, (5) validate start then reboot then start, (6) record it. Validation is two questions everywhere: does the service start, and does it survive a reboot.",
