      "id": "claim_62160b2929b54df681d64cacb07b94ba",
      "statement": "skills/ is the canonical HX capability library, subordinate to owner decisions, active architecture, live evidence, runbooks, and smoke-test acceptance criteria. Before operational use of a component skill, read skills/SKILL-GOVERNANCE.md and skills/SKILL-REGISTRY.md, then the wrapper skills/<component>/. Skills may guide planning, installation, troubleshooting, upgrades, and validation prep, but cannot authorize host-placement, container/cloud/embedded deployment, cluster topology, network/security/storage changes, model-placement changes, permanent integration, or PASS-criteria changes. Skills never contain credentials.",
