    {
      "id": "claim_7fa5fcc65f0843a6a65ae1476a09dea5",
      "statement": "HX maintains two complementary evergreen roadmaps: docs/00-control/HX-ECO-SYSTEM-BASE-IMPLEMENTATION-PRIORITY.md (deployment/build order and BASE PASS boundaries) and docs/00-control/HX-ECO-SYSTEM-SMOKE-TEST-ROADMAP.md (ordered proof dependencies, prior PASS evidence, companion gates, permitted limited validation integration). The smoke roadmap inherits the deployment roadmap and never authorizes testing a component before the SUT is installed/ready. HX uses cumulative proof with minimal live coupling.",
