      "id": "claim_2948603d25364c8ead67dc6bcab9767f",
      "statement": "Smoke-test authority is layered: the smoke-test roadmap defines which proof runs next and which prior PASS evidence it consumes; HX-SMOKE-TESTING-OPERATING-MODEL.md defines how the validation subsystem fits together; smoke-tests/*.md defines what each component must prove; HX-5-SMOKE-TEST-PROCESS-AND-PROCEDURES.md defines how HX executes and retains the proof; tools/hx-smoke-runner/ contains the repository-owned helper implementation. After CentCom activation (A5), later component smoke tests run remotely from HX-5 when the product exposes a LAN/API/protocol/native-client/UI surface.",
